<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:25:56 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>美国人对中期选举的公正性和准确性有多少信心？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/05/how-confident-are-americans-in-the-midterm-elections-fairness-and-accuracy/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.05_midterm_voting_featured.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;超过一半的美国人相信 2026 年中期选举将是公平的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 13:30:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/05/how-confident-are-americans-in-the-midterm-elections-fairness-and-accuracy/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对美国学校的语言学习有何看法？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/03/what-do-americans-think-about-language-learning-in-us-schools/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/08/SR_26.08.03_foreign-language_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;十分之四的美国人表示，对于在美国长大的孩子来说，学习英语以外的语言极其或非常重要。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 01:24:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/08/03/what-do-americans-think-about-language-learning-in-us-schools/</guid></item><item><title>最高法院的赞成率仍接近历史低点</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/30/favorable-views-of-supreme-court-remain-near-historic-low/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/07/SR_26.07.30_scotus_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;目前，一半的美国人对最高法院持负面看法，而大约有一半的美国人对最高法院持正面看法。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:25:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/07/30/favorable-views-of-supreme-court-remain-near-historic-low/</guid></item><item><title>皮尤研究中心如何在我们的工作中使用人工智能（以及没有使用人工智能）</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/decoded/2026/07/30/how-pew-research-center-is-and-is-not-using-ai-in-our-work-2/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2024/08/D_24.08.27_LLM_1.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在这篇文章中，我们将分享当前人工智能内部使用指南和潜在的实验领域。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:25:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/decoded/2026/07/30/how-pew-research-center-is-and-is-not-using-ai-in-our-work-2/</guid></item><item><title>视频：民意调查到底有多精确？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/methods/2026/07/29/video-how-precise-are-polls-really/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/07/PEW_M101_Thumb_EP5_Wide_B-1.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;民意调查到底有多精确？这里有一个小秘密：即使是最好的民意调查机构在分享结果时也需要一些回旋余地。这个“回旋余地”（也称为误差幅度）是真实答案可能落入的范围。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:25:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/methods/2026/07/29/video-how-precise-are-polls-really/</guid></item></channel></rss>